# Social brand kit — what NOT to commit.
# Rule: commit only STABLE brand files (voice, guardrails, tokens, logo, fonts, identity docs).
# Anything that changes with every post stays local, otherwise every post means a commit/PR/merge.
# After scheduling, the source of truth is the scheduler (text, date) and the media host (image).

# Other creators' content (reference only) — private
inspiration/*
!inspiration/README.md
!inspiration/notes.md

# Per-post working files and generated output — recreate with the skills
calendar/*
!calendar/README.md
designs/*/
assets/uploads/*
assets/backgrounds/
.render/

# Files edited constantly (running idea list, monthly results): keep local, back up by hand.
# Safety copies for restoring after a branch switch that deletes/overwrites them.
idea-backlog.md
results.md
.local-backup/
